+/*
+ * Custom: F-134 Wandering Isle (Pandaren start zone) scripts.
+ *
+ * Ported from the TrinityCore MoP Classic port's src/server/scripts/Pandaria/zone_the_wandering_isle.cpp (GPL-2.0),
+ * under the same script names, which F-134's creature_template / creature / gameobject_template /
+ * spell_script_names / areatrigger_scripts rows use. AzerothCore differences handled here:
+ * - TrinityCore's StringId spawn lookups use the spawn ids F-134's port gave those spawns, and its path, gossip menu,
+ *   entry and phase ids go through wandering_isle_ids.h, which the port writes.
+ * - 3.3.5a clients only report entering an area trigger, so the trigger scripts that act on leaving are polled
+ *   (WanderingIsleTriggerExitScript).
+ * - 3.3.5a has no alternate power: the meditation (bar 149, 90) and Shen-zin Su (bar 158, 700) bars count the
+ *   periodic ticks of their auras (F-134 makes the enable-alternate-power aura a dummy).
+ * - Flying paths built at runtime (Zhao-Ren's circle, the balloon's legs) are splines whose end is polled.
+ * - PhasingHandler::OnConditionChange is F-013's PhaseMgr::Recalculate.
+ * - The finale ("A New Fate", 31450): F-020 / F-021's Pandaren already have their side, so the spirit of Master
+ *   Shang Xi completes it and sends them to their capital instead of offering MoP's faction choice.
+ */
+
